# Boot; Select from the title to ENTER NAME; eight more Selects spell AAAAAAAA, which fills the
# name and puts the wheel on its "done" glyph; Select confirms it, and the START GAME menu
# comes up (NEW GAME / TUTORIAL). Two more Selects deal the first hand: by frame 3500 the
# player holds two cards at a six-seat table with the blinds posted and a $30 pot
# (analysis/coverage/first-hand-frame3500.png), and the next Select continues the hand.
# Recorded from the pinned emulator (tests/record.sh); checked by tests/diff.sh, and the
# screenshot by tests/frames.sh.
